                "notes": "This game contains intense sequences involving alien combat, scenes of graphic blood and gore, and psychological themes that explore the breakdown of human characters under pressure. As their mental states deteriorate, some characters may turn against their teammates, adding an unpredictable element of suspense and betrayal. It is recommended for mature audiences due to the frequent depictions of violence, psychological distress, and intense atmospheric tension."
